# What is JayJay?
what-is-jayjay = JayJay 是什么？

# A native GUI for <a href="https://github.com/jj-vcs/jj">Jujutsu (jj)</a> on macOS and Linux — the version control system that reimagines the git model with mutable history, changes instead of commits, and bookmarks instead of branches. Built with Rust (wrapping <code>jj-lib</code> directly, no CLI scraping) and SwiftUI.
a-native-gui-for-jujutsu-jj = <a href="https://github.com/jj-vcs/jj">Jujutsu (jj)</a> 的原生图形客户端，支持 macOS 和 Linux。Jujutsu 是一个重新构想 git 模型的版本控制系统，使用可变历史，用变更取代提交，用书签取代分支。JayJay 使用 Rust（直接封装 <code>jj-lib</code>，不解析 CLI 输出）和 SwiftUI 构建。

# Is there a GUI for Jujutsu?
is-there-a-gui-for-jujutsu = Jujutsu 有图形界面吗？

# Yes — JayJay is a full-featured native jj GUI for macOS and Linux: DAG visualization, unified + side-by-side diffs with tree-sitter highlighting, interdiff, diff edit mode, file annotate, one-click conflict resolution, and every common jj operation (squash, split, absorb, revert, merge, duplicate, describe, abandon) without memorizing flags.
yes-jayjay-is-a-full-featured = 有。JayJay 是适用于 macOS 和 Linux 的全功能原生 jj 图形客户端：DAG 可视化、带 tree-sitter 高亮的统一和并排差异、interdiff、差异编辑模式、文件逐行追溯、一键解决冲突，以及所有常用 jj 操作（squash、split、absorb、revert、merge、duplicate、describe、abandon），无需记忆命令参数。

# How do I install JayJay on macOS?
how-do-i-install-jayjay-on = 如何在 macOS 上安装 JayJay？

# <code>brew install --cask hewigovens/tap/jayjay</code> is the easiest path — Homebrew 6.0 trusts the cask the first time you install it. Or download the signed, notarized app from <a href="https://github.com/hewigovens/jayjay/releases/latest">GitHub Releases</a>. Requires macOS 26 or later.
brew-install-cask-hewigovens-tap-jayjay = 最简单的方式是 <code>brew install --cask hewigovens/tap/jayjay</code>，Homebrew 6.0 会在首次安装时信任该 cask。也可以从 <a href="https://github.com/hewigovens/jayjay/releases/latest">GitHub Releases</a> 下载已签名并公证的应用。需要 macOS 26 或更高版本。

# Does JayJay support interdiff (comparing two revisions)?
does-jayjay-support-interdiff-comparing-two = JayJay 支持 interdiff（比较两个修订）吗？

# Yes. Shift-click two revisions in the DAG to compare them PR-style — the same unified and side-by-side views with word-level highlighting, rendering the difference between the two change contents.
yes-shift-click-two-revisions-in = 支持。在 DAG 中按住 Shift 点击两个修订，即可像 PR 一样比较它们：使用同样的统一和并排视图及词级高亮，呈现两个变更内容之间的差异。

# Does JayJay support side-by-side diffs?
does-jayjay-support-side-by-side = JayJay 支持并排差异吗？

# Yes. Toggle unified and side-by-side with one click. Both use tree-sitter syntax highlighting and word-level highlights. Image files (PNG, JPG, SVG, HEIC...) render as actual before/after images, and Markdown, notebooks, CSV/TSV, SARIF, and binary property lists have rich previews when source text is not enough.
yes-toggle-unified-and-side-by = 支持。一键切换统一和并排视图，两者都使用 tree-sitter 语法高亮和词级高亮。图片文件（PNG、JPG、SVG、HEIC 等）以实际的前后图片显示；当源文本不够直观时，Markdown、Notebook、CSV/TSV、SARIF 和二进制属性列表还有富预览。

# Can JayJay extract individual lines or hunks into a new change?
can-jayjay-extract-individual-lines-or = JayJay 能把单独的行或差异块提取到新变更吗？

# Yes — that's diff edit mode. Select files, hunks, or line ranges and split them into a new child or parallel change. On the working copy you can also right-click → Abandon Selected Lines to drop individual edits.
yes-thats-diff-edit-mode-select = 能，这就是差异编辑模式。选择文件、差异块或行范围，然后把它们拆分到新的子变更或并行变更中。在工作副本上，还可以右键 →“放弃所选行”来丢弃个别修改。

# How is JayJay different from using jj on the command line?
how-is-jayjay-different-from-using = JayJay 和命令行的 jj 有什么不同？

# It complements the CLI rather than replacing it. The DAG graph, visual diff review, diff-edit, evolution viewer, and bookmark manager are far easier in a GUI. The command palette (<kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>⇧</kbd> <kbd>P</kbd>) searches actions and local help, and takes a <code>jj</code> (or <code>!</code>) prefix to run raw jj in-window.
it-complements-the-cli-rather-than = 它是 CLI 的补充，而不是替代。DAG 图、可视化差异评审、差异编辑、演化查看器和书签管理器在图形界面中要容易得多。命令面板（<kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>⇧</kbd> <kbd>P</kbd>）可以搜索操作和本地帮助，并支持 <code>jj</code>（或 <code>!</code>）前缀，在窗口内运行原始 jj 命令。

